[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0151","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0151.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0752","title":"Adobe Flash Player 类型混淆内存破坏漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）内存破坏漏洞（CWE-843）。攻击者通过构造特制的 SWF 文件，诱使用户在受影响的 Flash Player 版本中打开，即可触发类型混淆错误，导致内存破坏。成功利用该漏洞可导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.15 之前版本和 11.1.102.62 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。Adobe 已在 2012 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0752"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-16T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.15 或 11.1.102.62 及以上版本（桌面平台）；Android 2.x/3.x 升级至 11.1.111.6，Android 4.x 升级至 11.1.115.6。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止维护，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 以根除风险。如无法立即卸载，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件，并将 chrome://settings/content/flash 设为「禁止网站运行 Flash」。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0144.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48819","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-07.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-03.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14654","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0752.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0752","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0752","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0752.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob