":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/78911","http://secunia.com/advisories/47896","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/02062012_player/en/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51883","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73018","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2012/CVE-2012-0922.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0922.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0922","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0922.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0922.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0922.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0922.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0922.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2012/CVE-2012-0922.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0922.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0006","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0991","title":"OpenEMR 4.1.0 路径遍历本地文件包含漏洞","description":"OpenEMR 4.1.0 存在多处目录遍历漏洞，远程认证用户可通过在 contrib/acog/print_form.php、load_form.php、view_form.php 或 trend_form.php 等页面的 formname 参数中注入 ..（点点）序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。攻击者无需特殊权限，仅需拥有系统合法账号即可利用该漏洞获取敏感信息，如配置文件、数据库凭证等。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 formname 参数进行充分的路径过滤与校验，属于典型的 CWE-22 路径遍历漏洞，CVSS 评分 3.5，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0991"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-02-07T21:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:37Z","remediation":"升级 OpenEMR 至 4.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 formname 参数路径遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 contrib/acog/print_form.php、interface/patient_file/encounter/load_form.php、view_form.php、trend_form.php 中对 formname 参数实施白名单校验，仅允许预定义表单文件名，拒绝包含 ../ 的输入。同时限制 Web 服务器对敏感目录的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2012-02/0004.html","http://osvdb.org/78727","http://osvdb.org/78728","http://osvdb.org/78729","http://osvdb.org/78730","http://secunia.com/advisories/47781","http://www.open-emr.org/wiki/index.php/OpenEMR_Patches","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51788","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/72914","https://www.htbridge.ch/advisory/HTB23069","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36648","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0991.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-0991.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0991.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-0991.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2012-0991-2151.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2012-0991-2148.yaml","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2012-0991-2152.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0991.json","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/dbdf1e4a87f3d6b60359be7fe9f0121dcd896959/reports/cves.jsonl","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/05/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/liansweb/fingerprint-warehouse/blob/9924bfe4dc430c02949afebfd2578d4ef412c900/fingerprint/FingerprintHub-plugins/openemr/openemr/CVE-2012-0991.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0155","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0830","title":"PHP PHP php_register_variable_ex 函数远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.9 及之前版本在修复哈希碰撞拒绝服务漏洞（CVE-2011-4885）时引入了新的远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞位于 php_variables.c 文件中的 php_register_variable_ex() 函数，修复方案新增了 max_input_vars 配置变量用于限制输入变量数量，但当输入变量超过该阈值且正在处理的变量为数组类型时，会触发数组处理逻辑错误，导致任意代码执行。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的包含大量数组变量的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响所有使用 PHP 5.3.9 的 Web 服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0830"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-06T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 PHP 至 5.3.10 或更高版本，该版本已修复 php_register_variable_ex() 中因 max_input_vars 超限导致的数组处理不当问题。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中将 max_input_vars 设置为较低值（如 100）并限制 max_input_nesting_level 以降低攻击面，同时部署 WAF 规则拦截超量 POST 参数请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://h20000.www2.hp.com/bizsupport/TechSupport/Document.jsp?objectID=c03360041","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00013.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00016.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134012830914727&w=2","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/02/02/12","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/02/03/1","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0092.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/47801","ht