-AVE-2012-0155.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0005","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0981","title":"phpShowtime 2.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"phpShowtime 2.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 文件的 'r' 参数传递包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意路径，绕过访问限制，遍历并列出服务器上任意目录及图片文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响 phpShowtime 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0981"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-02-02T17:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:36Z","remediation":"phpShowtime 2.0 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议立即停用 phpShowtime，迁移至仍在维护的图片展示系统。如无法替换，需手动修改 index.php 对 r 参数做路径过滤，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列，并使用 realpath() 将解析路径限制在网站根目录内，同时在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面禁止访问非公开目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/47802","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/72824","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18435","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0981.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-0981.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0981.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0981.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2012/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0981.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/03/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-0981-2146.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2012-0981.yaml","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/9238de8f3cf6aee095a9c59813ce1d5bb6ba2585/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0981.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0039","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0450","title":"Mozilla Firefox 和 SeaMonkey 恢复密钥文件权限漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x 至 9.0 以及 SeaMonkey 2.7 之前版本在 Linux 和 Mac OS X 系统上存在不安全文件权限漏洞。当用户导出 Firefox Sync 密钥时，生成的 \"Firefox Recovery Key.html\" 文件权限设置不当，导致其他本地用户可通过标准文件系统操作读取该文件内容，从而获取 Firefox Sync 同步密钥，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0450"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-01T16:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:17Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 10.0 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 至 2.7 及以上版本，Thunderbird 至 10.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，确保 Firefox Sync 恢复密钥文件（Firefox Recovery Key.html）所在目录权限为 700，仅允许当前用户访问，并避免在多用户共享系统上使用 Firefox Sync 密钥导出功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00011.html","http://osvdb.org/78741","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:013","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-09.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=716868","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/72869","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14670","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0450.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087e